And he kind of, he grabbed it, I remember he grabbed it and he went, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, ah, and just this insane thing, and when he did it, I was so shocked, one that it worked, to how ridiculous it was and how hilarious it was.
然后他那种，他抓住了它，我记得他抓住那个地方然后喊着，啊，啊，啊，啊，啊，啊，啊，啊，啊，啊，做出了这种疯狂的举动，当他做出来的时候，我太震惊了，一方面是它居然成功了，另一方面是这太荒谬了，也太搞笑了。

