When I was doing what's going, oh my God, because also there's something unbelievably hilarious and upsetting, like there's eight different emotions going on.
当我表现出那种状态时，哦天哪，因为其中既有难以置信的搞笑，又有一种沮丧感，就好像有八种不同的情绪同时发生。

00:29:33.940 --> 00:29:34.980
It is, it's psychotic.
真是太神经质了。

